      "id": "P24_20",
      "topic": "Algebra",
      "sub_topic": "Linear Programming",
      "difficulty": "medium",
      "question": "Maximize Z = 3x + 4y subject to x + y \u2264 4, x \u2265 0, y \u2265 0. The maximum value is:",
