        "A) 3",
        "B) 2",
        "C) 4",
        "D) 6"
      ],
      "correct_option": "C",
      "explanation": "|A| = 2(4-1) - 1(2-1) + 1(1-2) = 2(3) - 1(1) + 1(-1) = 6 - 1 - 1 = 4. Since A\u207b\u00b9 = adj(A)/|A|, we have k = |A| = 4."
